    <briefdescription>
<para>NIST SP 800-232 ASCON XOF. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Extendable-Output Function implementation for ASCON. configurable for memory efficiency xor performance. Uses atomic 32-bit operations while maintaining explicit state machines that operate on 64-bit state for compilation targets in 32-bit microprocessors. The compiler is not responsible to implement the state machine.</para>
